{
  "version": 6,
  "vendor": {
    "org.degoras.readme": {
      "what": [
        "PERSONAL presets. Copy to CMakeUserPresets.json (gitignored) and edit freely -- nothing here is tracked,",
        "so it can never break anyone else's machine.",
        "",
        "The prose lives under 'vendor' because CMake rejects any unrecognised field in the root object, and",
        "JSON has no comments. CMake ignores 'vendor' by design, so this is the one place it can go.",
        "",
        "This file exists because the repository used to SHIP a CMakeUserPresets.json naming E:/msys64/ucrt64 --",
        "a drive present on no machine in the project. Every fresh clone therefore got two presets that could",
        "not configure. A personal presets file is per-developer by CMake convention; tracking one poisons every",
        "clone with another machine's layout."
      ],
      "when": [
        "You do NOT need this file inside the DegorasSLR environment. The launcher exports DEVSYSTEM_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT,",
        "DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES, DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS and VCPKG_DEFAULT_TRIPLET, which is what the generic mingw-* and",
        "unix-* presets read: builds go to $DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES/DegorasKinesis/<preset> and installs to",
        "$DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS/DegorasKinesis/<triplet>.",
        "",
        "It is for building OUTSIDE that environment. The generic presets are gated on those variables, so without",
        "them CMake reports every preset as disabled -- and 'cmake --list-presets' comes back EMPTY -- rather than",
        "quietly writing the build somewhere unexpected. Either export the variables yourself, or override them",
        "here as the two examples below do.",
        "",
        "DEVSYSTEM_TOOLCHAIN is optional and selects the compiler DRIVER: set it to 'clang' on a clang64 prefix so",
        "the toolchain file invokes clang.exe rather than gcc.exe. It matters because MSYS2 ships gcc.exe on",
        "clang64 as a byte-identical copy of clang, so without it a configure log reads 'GNU' for a clang build."
      ]
    }
  },
  "configurePresets": [
    {
      "name": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "displayName": "My machine -- MinGW Shared Debug",
      "inherits": "mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "environment": {
        "DEVSYSTEM_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT": "C:/msys64/ucrt64",
        "DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES": "C:/dev/buildtrees",
        "DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS": "C:/dev/deploys",
        "VCPKG_DEFAULT_TRIPLET": "x64-mingw-dynamic"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "my-tree-local",
      "displayName": "My machine -- build and install beside the sources",
      "inherits": "mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "binaryDir": "${sourceDir}/../build/${presetName}",
      "installDir": "${sourceDir}/../build/${presetName}/install",
      "environment": {
        "DEVSYSTEM_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT": "C:/msys64/clang64",
        "DEVSYSTEM_TOOLCHAIN": "clang",
        "DEVSYSTEM_BUILDTREES": "unused-here-but-must-be-non-empty-to-pass-the-gate",
        "DEVSYSTEM_DEPLOYS": "unused-here-but-must-be-non-empty-to-pass-the-gate",
        "VCPKG_DEFAULT_TRIPLET": "x64-mingw-dynamic"
      }
    }
  ],
  "buildPresets": [
    { "name": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb", "configurePreset": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb" },
    { "name": "my-tree-local",        "configurePreset": "my-tree-local" }
  ],
  "testPresets": [
    { "name": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb", "configurePreset": "my-mingw-dynamic-deb",
      "output": { "outputOnFailure": true } }
  ]
}
